        about_title: "Who we are",
        about_p1: "Qubly visualises and enhances architectural and real estate projects, turning ideas, floor plans and models into realistic images that help people see, understand and desire what has yet to take shape.",
        about_p2: "We support architecture studios, real estate agencies, developers and investors, tailoring each project to their design, promotional and commercial goals.",
        about_p3: "In many industries, a prototype is built before a product is made. In architecture, anticipating the final result is more complex: a building or renovation requires significant investment, and changes on site can mean extra costs and delays. Photorealistic images become a design and review tool for assessing and refining a project while changes are still easier and less expensive.",
